%%% note
記述子に無い型 (.t.B) を参照するフィールドのある記述子で書く。
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import toBase64 from dw::core::Binaries
output text/plain
---
toBase64(write({n: "x"}, "application/x-protobuf", {descriptorUrl: "test/fixtures/dw/protobuf_test/broken/unresolved.desc", messageType: "t.A"}))
%%% error
com.google.protobuf.Descriptors$DescriptorValidationException - t.A.b: ".t.B" is not defined.
